      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "FixedJoint and ConfigurableJoint *delete the component* when the joint breaks. This means if you want to respawn a breakable object, you can't use AddComponent to add the joints back.\n\nA workaround I found is to delete the entire connected series of rigidbodies and then recreate it from a prefab using Instantiate. But this is annoying if there's any networking on attached scripts. Which can't be instantiated.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
  ],
  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-04-06T21:51:25.226Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Please expose the GameObject.AddComponent function. If you are concerned about adding components that aren't whitelisted, scan the type against your type whitelist and don't create the component if it's not in the whitelist.",
